SeCreateSymbolicLinkPrivilege             Create symbolic links                              Enabled
SeDelegateSessionUserImpersonatePrivilege Obtain an impersonation token for another user     Enabled</span></pre>
      </div>

      <p>Despite not being logged in as <code>NT AUTHORITY\SYSTEM</code>, we have the same privileges and permissions as it does, which means we have successfully completed our goal.</p>

